/-!
# Metric bounds for the polygonal cells in a recursive Moise band

The exact auxiliary cells use loop-erased synchronized crosscuts, whereas
the individual Chapter 9 band cells deliberately retain the original
trimmed crosscuts.  Thus their metric control comes directly from the
`synchronizedReturnSet` estimates, not from containment in an auxiliary
cell.
-/

namespace Schoenflies

open Metric Set Function
open LeanEval.Topology.ClassificationOfSurfaces.Moise

